{"id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-module.md","title":"Module","display":"df-module — Module","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-module","aliases":["58-df-module","Module"],"display":"df-module — Module","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-module"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-module</span><span>Module</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-module — Module"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\)</span> (unital-ring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S\\)</span> (abelian-group predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (structured left-module predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Module}\">\\(\\operatorname{Module}\\)</span> (carrier-level compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\odot:R\\times M\\to M\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;\\bigl((r+_R s)\\odot m=(r\\odot m)+_M(s\\odot m)\\land r\\odot(m+_M n)=(r\\odot m)+_M(r\\odot n)\\land(r\\cdot_R s)\\odot m=r\\odot(s\\odot m)\\land1_R\\odot m=m\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\odot:R\\times M\\to M\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;\\bigl((r+_R s)\\odot m=(r\\odot m)+_M(s\\odot m)\\land r\\odot(m+_M n)=(r\\odot m)+_M(r\\odot n)\\land(r\\cdot_R s)\\odot m=r\\odot(s\\odot m)\\land1_R\\odot m=m\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Module: generalization of vector space over ring</li>\n<li>Module homomorphism sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_R(M,N)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_R(M,N)\\)</span> are derived from this action-preserving structure.</li>\n<li>Left/right: action on different sides of ring</li>\n<li>Submodule: subgroup closed under scalar multiplication</li>\n<li>Free module: has basis, generalizes vector space</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Eisenbud, Commutative Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S$ (unital-ring predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S$ (abelian-group predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Module}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module} \\vdash \\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\odot:R\\times M\\to M\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;\\bigl((r+_R s)\\odot m=(r\\odot m)+_M(s\\odot m)\\land r\\odot(m+_M n)=(r\\odot m)+_M(r\\odot n)\\land(r\\cdot_R s)\\odot m=r\\odot(s\\odot m)\\land1_R\\odot m=m\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{Module}(M,R)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_R(M,N)","display":false}],"bytes":1690,"backlinks":[{"id":"34946ea21ee88f10","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (structured module predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])"},{"id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (fully structured module predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])"},{"id":"10e6ac165c352cd8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (fully structured module predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])"},{"id":"108885c3887e8986","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (module predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])"},{"id":"85a2ae5fb67dda7f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot_M)$ 是结构参数完全显式的左模谓词（see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]）"},{"id":"153f6e